<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="77151" href="schedule/2022/fall/CHBE/494/77151.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2022" href="schedule/2022.xml">2022</calendarYear><term id="120228" href="schedule/2022/fall.xml">Fall 2022</term><subject id="CHBE" href="schedule/2022/fall/CHBE.xml">Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering</subject><course id="494" href="schedule/2022/fall/CHBE/494.xml">Special Topics</course></parents><sectionNumber>DS </sectionNumber><sectionTitle>Chemical Data Science &amp; Engrg</sectionTitle><creditHours>3 hours</creditHours><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>Meets with CHBE 594 DS/CHEM 492.  This course serves as an introduction to data-driven and machine learning techniques in chemistry and chemical engineering. Surveyed topics will include standard regression and classification algorithms, neural network architectures, unsupervised learning, clustering, molecular featurization techniques and best practices for machine learning.  The course serves as a practical introduction to these techniques in Python using existing chemical datasets.</sectionText><sectionNotes>Restricted to Undergrad - Urbana-Champaign.</sectionNotes><partOfTerm>1</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>CrossListOpen (Restricted)</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2022-08-22Z</startDate><endDate>2022-12-07Z</endDate><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="LEC">Lecture</type><start>12:30 PM</start><end>01:50 PM</end><daysOfTheWeek>TR     </daysOfTheWeek><roomNumber>165</roomNumber><buildingName>Noyes Laboratory</buildingName><instructors><instructor lastName="Chiang" firstName="H">Chiang, H</instructor><instructor lastName="Jackson" firstName="N">Jackson, N</instructor><instructor lastName="Shukla" firstName="D">Shukla, D</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>